docs {
  ### User Signup - Email Already Registered
  Attempts to register using an email address that is already associated with another account.
  
  #### Response (400 Bad Request)
  ```json
  {
    "statusCode": 400,
    "message": "Email already registered",
    "error": "Bad Request"
  }
  ```
}
